<!--
WR2 worktree garbage collector — daily 08:00 WITA (Pro only).

Promoted from com.balizero.wr2.worktree-gc.daily.plist.example (A1 finding
#4, 2026-07-14): the cron was never installed — only the .example template
existed. This canon plist follows the W84 trampoline sweep pattern (#2421):
ProgramArguments points to the wrapper deployed OUTSIDE the TCC-protected
~/Desktop (infra/launchagents/wrappers/wr2-worktree-gc-run.sh, declared in
infra/home-fork/declared-pairs.json), which probes TCC + trampolines via
ssh-localhost before touching ~/nuzantara.

REPORT-ONLY BY DESIGN: the wrapper never passes the apply flag to
scripts/wr2_worktree_gc.py. Two blocking gaps found during promotion (see
PR body): (1) the script has no 3-AND safety check (no live-process check,
no lease check, no content-on-main check, pure age>24h); (2) its
WORKTREE_PREFIX ("wr2-run-") no longer matches scripts/agent_start.py's
current naming convention ("lane-task_id"), so even in apply mode it
would find zero real candidates today. Arming apply mode is left to
whoever closes those gaps, not part of this promotion.

Install (Pro, generic installer already globs com.balizero.wr2.*.plist):
    cp infra/launchagents/wrappers/wr2-worktree-gc-run.sh ~/scripts/
    chmod 755 ~/scripts/wr2-worktree-gc-run.sh
    ./scripts/install_wr2_launchagents.sh

Kill switch (without removing plist):
    launchctl setenv WR2_WORKTREE_GC_ENABLED false
-->
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.balizero.wr2.worktree-gc.daily</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/nuzantara/scripts/wr2-worktree-gc-run.sh</string>
    </array>

    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>0</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>0</integer>
    </dict>
    <!-- 00:00 UTC = 08:00 WITA -->

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>HOME</key>
        <string>/Users/nuzantara</string>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
        <key>WR2_WORKTREE_GC_ENABLED</key>
        <string>true</string>
        <key>WR2_WORKTREE_GC_MAX_AGE_HOURS</key>
        <string>24</string>
    </dict>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/logs/wr2-worktree-gc.log</string>

    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/logs/wr2-worktree-gc.error.log</string>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>

    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
